{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-142395","model_call":37,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1018"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q1018"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_43_348846183#6_766498618","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1018","rank":2,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_43_348846183#6_766498618\" , \"end_char\": 4580.000000 , \"headings\": \" Help End Animal Testing Help End Animal Testing Ways You Can Help End Animal Testing – and Help Laboratory Animals List of Charities That Oppose Animal Testing Read More Information About <cover>Animal Testing Share this: Like this: \" , \"segment\": \"Here are some ideas to get you started. Shop Cruelty-Free Stores – What stores are the most cruelty-free? Find out! Share these Infographics and Educational Materials – Please share PCRM’s Tail of Toxics infographic, Tail of Toxics video, and in your workplace or school offer PCRM’s animal experimentation resources. Boycott </cover>Companies That Are Cruel to Animals – Don’t support or buy from any company or brand that tests on animals, or harms, injures or kills animals. Boycott them instead, and ask friends and family to boycott them as well. Share your boycott on social media. Handout Brochures, Outreach and Education Materials – For students, teachers and community and animal activists who want to raise awareness about animal testing. Go Vegan! – How does being vegan help ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_43_348846183#6_766498618","rank":2,"relevance":2}]},"time":10},"model_calls":37,"document_judgments":23,"relevance_3":2,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
